# The coordinator needs only its Dockerfile and Python package. Keep engine
# checkouts, datasets, tests, virtualenvs, outputs and credentials out of the
# build context, including any new top-level directories added in the future.
**
!Dockerfile
!.dockerignore
!requirements.txt
!processing/
!processing/**/*.py

# Never include generated Python or hidden metadata inside the source package.
**/__pycache__/
**/.git/
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.venv/
**/venv/
